{"id":"P037-2","subject":"P","unit":"P037","unitTitle":"2024 상반기 · 24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P037-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n다음 중 비례추이를 적용할 수 있는 항목을 모두 고른 것\n\n은?\n\n    ㉠ 동기속도     ㉡ 역률\n\n    ㉢ 입력        ㉣ 2차동손\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉡         ② ㉠㉢\n\n③ ㉠㉣         ④ ㉡㉢\n\n㉣ ㉡㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m26-q.webp","width":696,"height":605},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":362}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n인덕턴스가 8H 인 코일에 sinA 의 전류가\n\n흐를 때, 이 코일에 축적되는 에너지는 몇 J인가?\n\n\n① 80          ② 100\n\n③ 150         ④ 200\n\n⑤ 240","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":526},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m27-e1.webp","width":696,"height":983}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n다음과 같은 교류 브리지 회로에서, 검류계 Ⓖ에 전류가\n\n흐르지 않기 위한 은 몇 H 인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 20          ② 50\n\n③ 100         ④ 500\n\n⑤ 1000","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":752},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m28-e1.webp","width":696,"height":899}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n3상 3선식 1회선 배전선로의 수전단 측에 650kW,\n\n뒤진역률 80의 평형 3상 부하가 접속되어 있다.\n\n수전단 전압이 6500V이고, 전선 1가닥에 대한 저항이\n\n15Ω, 리액턴스가 10Ω인 경우, 송전단 측의 전압은\n\n몇 V인가?\n\n\n① 8150         ② 8350\n\n③ 8550         ④ 8750\n\n⑤ 8950","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m29-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m29-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1001}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n150kV의 송전선로에서 송전거리가 100km라고 할 때,\n\n송전용량 계수법에 의해 계산되는 송전용량은 몇 MW\n\n인가? (단, 송전용량 계수는 800으로 한다.)\n\n\n① 120         ② 150\n\n③ 180         ④ 240\n\n⑤ 300","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m30-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n안정도 향상 대책에서 전압변동 억제를 위한 대책방안으로\n\n옳은 것은?\n\n      ㉠ 속응여자 방식을 채용한다.\n\n      ㉡ 재폐로 방식을 채용한다.\n\n      ㉢ 중간 조상방식을 채용한다.\n\n      ㉣ 고속도 차단방식을 채용한다.\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉡         ② ㉠㉢\n\n③ ㉡㉢         ④ ㉠㉡㉢\n\n⑤ ㉠㉡㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":637},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m31-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n어느 수용가에 전력을 공급하기 위해 필요한 변압설비의\n\n용량이 650kVA 이다. 수용가의 역률이 85, 수용률\n\n이 50, 부등률이 1.2라고 한다면, 수용가의 부하 설비\n\n용량은 몇 kW인가?\n\n\n① 1228         ② 1288\n\n③ 1326         ④ 1560\n\n⑤ 1835","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m32-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m32-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n3개의 접지극 상호간의 저항을 측정하니 와 사이는\nΩ, 와 사이는 Ω, 와 사이는\nΩ이었다면, 지점의 접지 저항값은 몇 Ω인\n\n가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 20          ② 40\n\n③ 60          ④ 80\n\n⑤ 100","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m33-q.webp","width":696,"height":822},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m33-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1292}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n수도관을 접지극으로 사용하려고 한다. 수도관의 지름이\n\n75mm미만이고 그 길이가 분기점으로부터 5m이상이\n\n라면, 접지극으로 사용하기 위해서는 전기저항 값이 몇\n\nΩ이하이어야 하는가?\n\n\n① 2           ② 3\n\n③ 4           ④ 5\n\n⑤ 6","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":498},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m34-e1.webp","width":696,"height":590}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n  수중 조명등에 전기를 공급하기 위한 절연변압기의\n\n  사용전압은 1차측 전로의 경우 ( ㉠  )V, 2차측\n\n  전로의 경우 ( ㉡  )V이다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①         800               150\n\n ②         400               150\n\n ③         400               100\n\n ④         250               500\n\n ⑤         100                30","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m35-q.webp","width":678,"height":1022},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m35-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1009}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n 옥내에 시설하는 저압전선으로 나전선을 사용할 수 있\n\n 는 경우로는 (  ㉠      ), (  ㉡   )에 의하여 시\n\n 설하는 경우, 접촉전선으로 시설하는 경우가 있다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①     금속관        버스덕트\n\n ②     금속관        라이팅덕트\n\n ③    합성수지관       버스덕트\n\n ④    합성수지관       라이팅덕트\n\n ⑤     버스덕트       라이팅덕트","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m36-q.webp","width":678,"height":860},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m36-e1.webp","width":678,"height":873}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n다음과 같은 접지의 계통은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① TT          ② IT\n\n③ TN-C         ④ TN-S\n\n⑤ TN-C-S","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m37-q.webp","width":696,"height":842},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m37-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m37-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1429}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n정격전류 30A 의 주택용 배선용 차단기의 차단시간과 과\n\n전류 트립 동작전류A 는?\n\n\n       차단시간     과전류 트립 동작전류\n ①       120분               31.5A \n ②       60분               31.5A \n ③       60분               39.0A \n ④       60분               43.5A \n ⑤       120분               43.5A ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m38-q.webp","width":696,"height":536},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m38-e1.webp","width":678,"height":455},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m38-e2.webp","width":696,"height":724}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n다음의 항목에서 피뢰기가 갖추어야 할 구비조건으로 모두\n\n고른 것은?\n\n      ㉠ 제한전압이 낮을 것\n\n      ㉡ 방전내량이 클 것\n\n      ㉢ 상용주파 개시전압이 높을 것\n\n      ㉣ 충격방전 개시전압이 높을 것\n\n\n① ㉠㉡         ② ㉡㉢\n\n③ ㉢㉣         ④ ㉠㉡㉢\n\n⑤ ㉡㉢㉣","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m39-q.webp","width":696,"height":505},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m39-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1160}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n용어의 정의에 대한 다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n ⦁건축물 내부의 전기 사용장소에 고정시켜 시설하는\n\n  전선을 (  ㉠  )이라 한다.\n\n ⦁건축물 외부의 전기 사용장소에서 그 전기 사용장소\n\n  에서의 전기 사용을 목적으로 조영물에 고정시켜\n\n  시설하는 전선을 (  ㉡  )이라 한다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①     옥내배선        옥외배선\n\n ②     옥내배선        옥측배선\n\n ③     옥내배선        옥상배선\n\n ④     구내배선        옥측배선\n\n ⑤     구내배선        옥상배선","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m40-q.webp","width":678,"height":789},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m40-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1067}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 41번","searchText":" 41\n\n가공 전선로의 지지물이 원형 철근콘크리트주인 경우 갑종\n\n풍압하중은 몇 Pa을 기초로 하여 계산하는가?\n\n\n① 588         ② 882\n\n③ 1078         ④ 1117\n\n⑤ 1255","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m41","number":41},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m41-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m41-e1.webp","width":678,"height":815}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n  지선의 안전율은 (  ㉠  )이상, 허용 인장하중의\n\n  최저는 (  ㉡   )kN이다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①            1.5                  1.38\n\n ②            1.5                  4.31\n\n ③          2                   4.31\n\n ④            2.5                  1.38\n\n ⑤            2.5                  4.31","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m42-q.webp","width":678,"height":571},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m42-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1046}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n액체 유전체를 포함한 콘덴서의 용량이 F인 것에\n\n400kV의 전압을 가했을 경우에 흐르는 누설전류는 몇\n\nA 인가? (단, 유전체의 유전율은 Fm, 고유 저항은\nΩ· m이다.)\n\n\n                          \n①            ②      \n                          \n③            ④      \n\n    \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e16-m43","number":43},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m43-q.webp","width":696,"height":697},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e16-m43-e1.webp","width":696,"height":836}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P037-S2-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.05.19 한국가스기술공사 (사람인) · 객관식 44번","searchText":" 44\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 sinV일 때, 출력전압\n의 최대전압 값은 몇 V인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 15          ② 20\n\n③ 25          ④ 30\n\n⑤ 35","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기",